※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4631 LANG_BOUND_IN_NOT_HANDED_OUT

※ `let v: T in kept = …` receives an arena a call hands out with its answer, so its value is such a
※ call: a join makes no arena to receive.

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let s: str in k = "a" ⧺ "b"
    defer ⎕empty(k)
    if s = "ab": 0u6 else: 1u6
